type: software
title: "Busy Beaver: PA-independent Turing machines with 215, 213, and 211 working states"
authors:
  - family-names: "Chang"
    given-names: "James"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jamesyc/BusyBeaver"
abstract: >-
  Combined historical archive of three explicit binary Turing machines
  searching for contradictions in Peano arithmetic, with Lean formalizations
  for nonhalting, PA-unprovability, and later two-sided PA independence.
  Each version is preserved as a complete original Git tree.
